  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARTCP Trade &amp; Connectivity Programme - Asian Development Bank</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Trust Fund with ADB, aims to support the implementation of ADB&#x2019;s Strategy 2030 Operational Plan for Priority 7: Regional Cooperation and Integration  by financing regional cooperation and integration (RCI) activities in developing member countries (DMCs) in Asia covering Central, South and Southeast Asia (CSSEA)  , leading to improved integration with other regions of the world.</narrative>
  </description>
